[en.DECISION_LANDMINE_PIE]
Deploy a Pie in [FROM.GetName]

[en.DECISION_LANDMINE_PIE_desc]
“Calm down, our army treats prisoners well, come and try our freshly baked pie.”
§g“Please don’t! Just kill me, please!”§!

[en.DECISION_LANDMINE_PIE_COMPLETE_EFFECT_TOOLTIP]
Deploy a landmine in the current state. When an enemy controls this state, the landmine will explode and clear the organization of all §Ynon-titan armor§! or §Ycannon§! armies §R(including enemy and friendly forces)§! in the state.

[en.DECISION_LANDMINE_PIE_REMOVE_EFFECT_TOOLTIP]
The landmine will malfunction. During this time, if an enemy controls this state, the landmine will explode and clear the organization of all §Ynon-titan armor§! or §Ycannon§! armies §R(including enemy and friendly forces)§! in the state.

[zh.DECISION_LANDMINE_PIE]
在[FROM.GetName]部署一个派

[zh.DECISION_LANDMINE_PIE_desc]
“不要紧张，我们的军队善待俘虏，来尝尝我们刚烤好的派吧。”
§g“求求你们！杀了我吧！”§!

[zh.DECISION_LANDMINE_PIE_COMPLETE_EFFECT_TOOLTIP]
在当前地块部署一个地雷，当敌军控制这一地块时，地雷会引爆并将地块内的所有§Y非泰坦装甲§!和§Y加农炮§!部队§R（包括敌方和友方）§!组织度清零。

[zh.DECISION_LANDMINE_PIE_REMOVE_EFFECT_TOOLTIP]
地雷将失效。在此之前，如果敌军控制这一地块，地雷会引爆并将地块内的所有§Y非泰坦装甲§!和§Y加农炮§!部队§R（包括敌方和友方）§!组织度清零。
